xapsd (1.4.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * First release from the timlaing fork.
  * Debian packaging for amd64 and arm64 with interactive APNS configuration.
  * Unit tests with 85.4% statement coverage.
  * Security fixes for CVE-2023-45288, CVE-2024-45338, CVE-2024-51744,
    CVE-2025-22870, and GHSA-fv92-fjc5-jj9h.
  * Dependency updates for golang.org/x/net and golang.org/x/crypto.
  * Removed deprecated Apple self-service push certificate API.
  * CI/CD automation for linting, SonarQube Cloud, and release publishing.

 -- dovecot-xaps-daemon contributors <noreply@github.com>  Thu, 04 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0100
